    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveToObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO GrabObject\n\t\t\tIF DoesObjectFitCriteria? THEN\n\t\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIF IsTask1Enabled? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDO Task1\n\t\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\t\tIF IsTask2Enabled? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDO Task2\n\t\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
